My rating is 8/10.
Advantages:
* Good graphics: detailed cars, weather conditions and time of day;
* Over 50 car models and you can drive cars from the 80's and 90's;
* Ability to change car settings (arcade and simulation modes);
* Expanded single-player campaign with 60 hours of fun.
Disadvantages:
* Too few locations / countries (only 5 in rally mode);
* The stage generator is a good idea if the routes created are varied;
* CPU intelligence (the opponent can suddenly lose 20 seconds).

